@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.split
@title Media loading — Split only
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Split only
@entry split-path-change
@summary Show only the Split-specific step that bridges the shared Files current-path event into the shared viewer-loading pipeline.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-add, functionality.media-loading.common.list-selection, functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag split

@alias split = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PSplitTab

[split-path-change] Split Files current-path event <input>
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> split-path-result

[split-path-result] Split selected-path adapter <decision>
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Split viewer @ split.PSplitPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Blank current path" > split-no-request

[split-no-request] Split viewer request omitted <output>
= Split does not call the shared viewer-loading pipeline.
